  "instructions": [
    "Heat olive oil in a large saucepan over medium heat.",
    "Add chopped onion and cook until translucent, about 3-4 minutes.",
    "Add grated ginger and minced garlic and cook for another minute.",
    "Add cumin powder, turmeric, and salt. Cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Add refried beans and stir to combine. Cook for 2-3 minutes.",
    "Add Basmati rice and stir to combine. Cook for 2-3 minutes.",
    "Heat tadka oil in a small saucepan over low heat.",
    "Pour tadka oil over the rice and bean mixture. Stir to combine.",
    "Garnish with chopped fresh cilantro and a squeeze of lemon juice.",
    "Serve hot and enjoy!"
  ],
